@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title **Food Rescue Platform (Replate) - SLA & Time-Critical Lifespan Timing Diagram**

robust "Donation Listing" as Donation
robust "Matching Offer" as Offer
robust "Driver Assignment" as Driver
robust "Transit & Delivery" as Transit

@0
Donation is AVAILABLE
Offer is IDLE
Driver is OFFLINE
Transit is IDLE

@1
Donation is MATCHING
Offer is PENDING

@2
Offer is PENDING
note bottom of Offer : 15-Minute Expiry SLA Window Starts

@5
Offer is ACCEPTED
Donation is ACCEPTED
Driver is SEARCHING

@7
Driver is ASSIGNED
Donation is DRIVER_ASSIGNED
note bottom of Driver : 5-Minute Acceptance SLA

@8
Driver is ACCEPTED
Transit is EN_ROUTE_PICKUP
Donation is PICKUP_STARTED

@12
Transit is AT_PICKUP
note bottom of Transit : Inspection & Handover (5 min)

@14
Transit is EN_ROUTE_DROPOFF
Donation is IN_TRANSIT

@20
Transit is AT_DROPOFF
note bottom of Transit : Intake Inspection & Signature (5 min)

@22
Transit is DELIVERED
Donation is DELIVERED
Driver is AVAILABLE
Offer is COMPLETED

@25
Donation is ARCHIVED

@enduml
